% Generate pdd/cloud_server/config.py for operator-owned server settings.

Define frozen ServerSettings with database: Path and hidden-repr tokens: tuple[(owner, token)].
Defaults: public_url http://127.0.0.1:9877, origins localhost/127.0.0.1:9876,
session_timeout 120 seconds, example_limit 3, max_body_bytes 4 MiB.
Require distinct nonempty owners, distinct tokens of at least 32 characters, and at least one token.
Validate HTTP(S) public URL without credentials, query, or fragment.
Require session_timeout >=30, example_limit 0..10, max_body_bytes >=1024.
load_settings reads PDD_SERVER_TOKENS_FILE as a strict JSON owner-to-token object.
Otherwise use PDD_SERVER_TOKEN under owner named owner.
Read database, public URL, origins, session timeout, and example limit from documented server variables.
Expand filesystem paths. Never connect to a hosted identity service.
